'''Volume 34: The Revealed Truth''' is the 34th volume of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga and the fifth volume in the {{MangaArc|Diamond & Pearl}}. It is authored by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and illustrated by [[Satoshi Yamamoto]].

In VIZ Media's translation, this volume is published as volume five of a separately numbered series, "Pokémon Adventures: Diamond and Pearl/Platinum".

==Blurb==
''Lady feels betrayed when she finally discovers the truth about Diamond’s and Pearl’s identities. Is the trio’s journey—and friendship—over?! And how can our three heroes save three Legendary Lake Pokémon from Team Galactic…when each Legendary Pokemon is in a ''different'' lake?!''

''Meanwhile, what evil is Team Galactic secretly concocting in an abamdoned''{{sic}}'' factory…?''

Plus, meet Bronzong, Mothim, Staraptor, Gilscor{{sic}}, Lucario, Vespiquen, and many more Sinnoh Pokémon friends.

