* The Galactic bomb is complete.
* Ponyta evolves into {{TP|Platinum|Rapidash}}.
* The trio split up to stop the Galactic bomb.
* [[Byron]] gives Diamond his Shieldon.
* Diamond starts, and finishes his training.

